{"title":"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A container in the shape of a cube has dimensions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cm by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cm by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cm. The container is sitting on a horizontal table on one of its faces and is filled with water to a depth of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cm. In cm3, what is the volume of the water in the container?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The base of the cube has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aef620c9e0351d26690a92cc2c8ecacb6de03d91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 4 = 16 \\text{ cm}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />. Since the height of the water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca323f6b69ea131a9a8f962f8ddbd8ddc59583d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, the volume of the water in the container is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60deb47f5bd0b43c40a17c1549ce2de8201f3ae2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 \\times 2 = 32 \\text{ cm}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The volume of the container is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/5/695dbf1630b938987d7fa4df7268c145196143d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{3} = 64 \\text{ cm}^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />. Since the height of the water is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/e/47ed0af3fb1e7f9307936d515b32af160a494d6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{4} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" /> of the height of the cube, the volume of the water in the container is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the volume of the container is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/0/400f861c27260358b395f24a6ce198ce8c66b69f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} \\times 64 = 32 \\text{ cm}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"132\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC\" title=\"2024 CIMC\">2024 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017111247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 104/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1246/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2055/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.898      1 Template:CEMC_CIMC/CSMC_box\n100.00%   43.898      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37162:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017111247 and revision id 287059. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}